NO! NO!

254
00:09:17,182 --> 00:09:18,766
NO!

255
00:09:18,808 --> 00:09:21,228
WAIT. YOU DIDN'T JUST SIT
ON MY KIT KATS, DID YOU?

256
00:09:21,269 --> 00:09:24,814
NO. THERE WAS A LITTLE,
LITTLE DIP IN THE MARKET

257
00:09:24,856 --> 00:09:26,983
AND I LOST $13 MILLION.

258
00:09:27,025 --> 00:09:30,028
BUT THE KIT KATS
ARE ALL RIGHT?

259
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:32,322
WHAT AM I GOING TO DO?
WHAT AM I GOING TO DO?!

260
00:09:32,364 --> 00:09:34,366
I CAN'T CALL MY OFFICE--
THEY'LL KILL ME.

261
00:09:34,408 --> 00:09:36,910
I CAN'T CALL MY CLIENTS--
THEY'LL KILL THEMSELVES.

262
00:09:36,951 --> 00:09:38,245
GREAT. NOW MY CHEST HURTS.

263
00:09:38,286 --> 00:09:39,287
WHAT?

264
00:09:39,329 --> 00:09:41,164
MY CHEST HURTS.

265
00:09:41,206 --> 00:09:42,749
OH...

266
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:44,418
