IF THEY DIDN'T
HAVE TO WORK FOR
A COUPLE OF WEEKS.

276
00:10:05,897 --> 00:10:08,066
MOST PEOPLE
DON'T LIKE THEIR JOBS.

277
00:10:08,108 --> 00:10:09,359
