278
00:10:09,401 --> 00:10:11,445
I'VE BEEN NOT WORKING
FOR THREE HOURS

279
00:10:11,486 --> 00:10:13,280
AND I'M ALREADY GOING CRAZY.

280
00:10:13,321 --> 00:10:15,198
