WAS NATURE'S WAY
OF TELLING YOU TO DIE.

285
00:10:25,584 --> 00:10:27,461
BUT YOU'RE NOT GOING
TO DIE.

286
00:10:27,502 --> 00:10:29,379
I MEAN,
YOU ARE GOING TO DIE

287
