FOR TALKING OUT OF
YOUR ASS MAGAZINE.

292
00:10:42,641 --> 00:10:45,395
SO, WHAT'S GOING
ON WITH YOU?

293
00:10:45,437 --> 00:10:50,733
WELL, UM, I'VE BEEN DOING
A LOT MORE OF MY KARA-TE.

294
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:54,446
