I DON'T KNOW.

303
00:11:11,588 --> 00:11:13,423
YOU COULD TIE HER UP,
SHE COULD TIE YOU UP

304
00:11:13,465 --> 00:11:15,049
YOU COULD EAT STUFF
OFF EACH OTHER.

305
00:11:15,091 --> 00:11:16,426
HUH.

306
00:11:16,468 --> 00:11:18,928
YOU KNOW, DIRTY TALK,
MENAGE A TROIS, TOYS...

307
00:11:18,970 --> 00:11:20,263
WOW.

308
00:11:20,305 --> 00:11:21,764
