379
00:14:17,524 --> 00:14:19,609
YAY!

380
00:14:19,651 --> 00:14:21,319
YAY!

381
00:14:21,361 --> 00:14:24,322
SERIOUSLY, OUR SEX LIFE...

382
00:14:24,364 --> 00:14:25,948
I WAS THINKING MAYBE...

383
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:28,993
I DON'T KNOW,
WE COULD TRY SOME NEW THINGS

384
00:14:29,035 --> 00:14:30,119
YOU KNOW, FOR FUN.

385
00:14:30,161 --> 00:14:31,287
LIKE WHAT?

386
00:14:31,329 --> 00:14:33,289
WELL, I DON'T KNOW. UM...

387
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:39,295
WELL, WHAT IF WE, UH, WERE TO...

388
00:14:39,337 --> 00:14:41,589
TIE EACH OTHER UP?

389
00:14:43,174 --> 00:14:45,051
( stifled chuckle )

390
00:14:48,304 --> 00:14:53,017
