428
00:16:20,104 --> 00:16:22,565
I LOVE ARCHIE,
AND THE WHOLE GANG!

429
00:16:24,776 --> 00:16:29,363
WELL, UM, ARCHIE NEEDS
MONEY TO FIX HIS JALOPY.

430
00:16:29,405 --> 00:16:32,199
