THAT CAN'T HAVE LUMPS IN THEM.

436
00:16:51,469 --> 00:16:52,887
WAIT A MINUTE.

437
00:16:52,929 --> 00:16:54,848
THAT SOUNDS A LITTLE FAMILIAR.

438
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:59,352
