'CAUSE I THINK I READ IT.

439
00:17:03,690 --> 00:17:06,442
OH, MONICA, LISTEN,
I HAVE TO ASK.

440
00:17:06,484 --> 00:17:10,196
OKAY, JOEY TRIBBIANI INVITED
ME BACK TO HIS APARTMENT.

441
00:17:10,237 --> 00:17:13,031
