WITH A LOT OF GIRLS?

442
00:17:13,073 --> 00:17:14,450
YEAH, A LOT.

443
00:17:14,492 --> 00:17:16,118
A LOT, A LOT.

444
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,954
OH, AND I'M ONE OF THEM!

445
00:17:17,996 --> 00:17:19,873
WOW!

446
00:17:19,914 --> 00:17:22,959
OH, I JUST CANNOT BELIEVE THIS!

447
00:17:23,001 --> 00:17:25,336
I MEAN, JOEY TRIBBIANI!

448
00:17:25,378 --> 00:17:26,838
YOU KNOW,
IT'S NONE OF MY BUSINESS

449
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:27,964
BUT AREN'T YOU MARRIED?

450
00:17:28,006 --> 00:17:30,174
YEAH.

451
00:17:31,801 --> 00:17:34,512
OH, I WISH
WE COULD JUST NOT BE MARRIED

452
00:17:34,554 --> 00:17:36,096
