453
00:17:36,138 --> 00:17:40,184
YOU KNOW, I JUST WISH
WE COULD BE, LIKE, ON A BREAK.

454
00:17:41,853 --> 00:17:43,938
WELL, YOU'RE NOT.

455
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:44,939
IT'S SO EASY FOR YOU.

456
00:17:44,981 --> 00:17:46,232
YOU'RE NOT MARRIED.

457
00:17:46,273 --> 00:17:47,650
YOU CAN HAVE SEX
WITH WHOEVER YOU WANT.

458
00:17:47,692 --> 00:17:49,777
YEAH, I CAN.

459
00:17:49,819 --> 00:17:52,780
AND DON'T THINK I DON'T,
BECAUSE I DO.

460
00:17:52,822 --> 00:17:54,908
ALL THE TIME, YOU BETCHA.

461
00:17:56,784 --> 00:17:59,871
MONICA?
HMM?

462
00:17:59,913 --> 00:18:02,415
