485
00:18:46,667 --> 00:18:50,129
THERE SHOULDN'T BE
ALL THESE RULES AND
RESTRICTIONS, YOU KNOW?

486
00:18:50,170 --> 00:18:53,173
PEOPLE SHOULD BE
ABLE TO SLEEP WITH
WHOEVER THEY WANT

487
00:18:53,215 --> 00:18:54,383
WHENEVER...
RACHEL...

488
00:18:54,425 --> 00:18:55,843
I'M NEVER GOING
TO THINK IT'S OKAY

489
00:18:55,885 --> 00:18:57,261
FOR YOU TO CHEAT
ON YOUR HUSBAND.

490
00:18:57,303 --> 00:19:00,098
OH, WHAT DO YOU
KNOW, VIRGIN?

491
00:19:05,269 --> 00:19:06,813
PHOEBE?

492
00:19:06,854 --> 00:19:10,190
WHY IS SMOKE
COMING OUT OF THE BATHROOM?

493
00:19:10,232 --> 00:19:11,734
OH, YEAH, THE
DOCTOR SAID

494
00:19:11,776 --> 00:19:14,153
THAT COULD BE ONE
OF THE SIDE EFFECTS.

495
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:17,740
PHOEBE, PUT THAT CIGARETTE OUT.

496
00:19:17,782 --> 00:19:19,325
NO, IT'S NOT
A CIGARETTE.

497
00:19:19,366 --> 00:19:21,243
THE SMOKE IS
COMING OUT OF ME.

498
00:19:21,285 --> 00:19:22,870
PUT IT OUT!

499
00:19:22,912 --> 00:19:24,538
OKAY, OKAY!

500
00:19:26,415 --> 00:19:28,250
I'M SO GLAD YOU'RE HERE.

501
00:19:28,292 --> 00:19:29,794
COME ON.

502
00:19:29,836 --> 00:19:30,962
( phone ringing )

503
00:19:31,004 --> 00:19:32,630
I GOT IT.
GIVE IT TO ME.

504
00:19:32,672 --> 00:19:34,214
I GOT IT.
GIVE IT!

505
00:19:34,256 --> 00:19:36,258
( karate yell )

506
00:19:38,886 --> 00:19:40,471
HELLO.

507
00:19:40,513 --> 00:19:43,057
NO, SHE CAN'T COME TO
THE PHONE RIGHT NOW.

508
00:19:43,099 --> 00:19:44,684
OH. RIGHT.

509
00:19:44,725 --> 00:19:46,686
NO PROBLEM.
OKAY, BYE-BYE.

510
00:19:46,727 --> 00:19:48,479
WAS IT MY WORK? WERE THEY MAD?

511
00:19:48,521 --> 00:19:49,939
WAS IT JACK? DID HE YELL?

512
00:19:49,981 --> 00:19:50,982
JUST RELAX.

513
00:19:51,024 --> 00:19:52,025
NOBODY YELLED.

514
00:19:52,066 --> 00:19:53,192
JACK JUST WAS CALLING

515
00:19:53,233 --> 00:19:54,944
TO MAKE SURE
YOU WERE GETTING BETTER.

516
00:19:54,986 --> 00:19:56,696
THANK GOD.

517
00:19:56,737 --> 00:19:58,614
YEAH, SHE'S FIRED.

518
00:20:02,493 --> 00:20:04,871
You've done all you can,
Dr. Wesley.

519
00:20:04,912 --> 00:20:06,455
You've got to let her go.

520
00:20:06,497 --> 00:20:08,124
I suppose you're right, nurse.

521
00:20:08,166 --> 00:20:12,086
Good-bye and Godspeed,
Hope Brady.

522
00:20:12,128 --> 00:20:14,130
Not so fast, Wesley.

523
00:20:15,715 --> 00:20:17,008
Ramoray.

524
00:20:17,050 --> 00:20:19,093
That's right, Wesley.

525
00:20:19,135 --> 00:20:22,262
I just stopped by to say that...

526
00:20:22,304 --> 00:20:24,682
you're not a real doctor...

527
00:20:24,724 --> 00:20:26,767
and that woman's brain...

528
00:20:26,809 --> 00:20:27,935
is fine.

529
00:20:27,977 --> 00:20:29,269
OH, THANK GOD!

530
00:20:29,311 --> 00:20:30,813
OH, THANK GOD.

531
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:38,863
Hope.

532
00:20:38,905 --> 00:20:41,323
Hope.

533
00:20:41,365 --> 00:20:42,575
Drake.

534
00:20:42,616 --> 00:20:44,160
You're not dying,
Hope.

535
00:20:44,202 --> 00:20:47,121
You're going to live
a long, healthy life...

536
00:20:47,163 --> 00:20:48,372
with me.

537
00:20:48,414 --> 00:20:50,166
Oh, Drake.

538
00:20:55,004 --> 00:20:58,132
OKAY. HERE WE GO.

539
00:20:59,133 --> 00:21:00,176
OKAY.

540
00:21:00,218 --> 00:21:01,468
( clears throat )

541
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:02,511
MM...

542
00:21:04,013 --> 00:21:05,305
HI, JOEY.

543
00:21:05,347 --> 00:21:07,307
IT'S RACHEL.

544
00:21:07,349 --> 00:21:10,228
UM, I AM FREE TOMORROW NIGHT.

545
00:21:11,938 --> 00:21:14,607
YEAH, SURE. SURE,
I COULD BRING SOME SANDWICHES.

546
00:21:30,081 --> 00:21:34,085
[Captioned by
The Caption Center
WGBH Educational Foundation]

